<figure class="guide-figure" aria-label="Three independent tasks confirm a selected race place">
<div class="guide-entry-head"><strong>Selected place</strong><span>Open your race-entry Profile and check the deadline.</span></div>
<ul class="guide-tasks">
<li><strong>Sign</strong><span>The current participant agreement.</span></li>
<li><strong>Save</strong><span>All required race and emergency-contact details.</span></li>
<li><strong>Pay</strong><span>The entry fee, with payment confirmed by the service.</span></li>
</ul>
<div class="guide-entry-result"><strong>All three complete</strong><span>The race service confirms your place.</span></div>
<figcaption>Complete the tasks in any order, before the deadline. <a href="/diagrams/race-confirmation/index.html">Explore race confirmation</a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
